# =============================================================================

# ---- Unity stuff (not needed for the web port build) ----
Assets/
Library/
Logs/
Packages/
ProjectSettings/
UserSettings/
mod-pack-example/
docs/
tools/
Makefile
SECURITY.md
THIRD_PARTY.md
CHANGELOG.md
*.csproj
*.sln
*.unityproj

# ---- Web port artifacts (regenerated in container) ----
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
.turbo
.cache
coverage
**/coverage
*.log
*.tsbuildinfo

# ---- Misc ----
.git
.github
.idea
.vscode
.DS_Store
data
*.sqlite

# ---- Infra (deploy stack — not part of the runtime image) ----
infra/
